RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=3;BYMONTHDAY=31
SUMMARY:Jordan: Annual list of workers in employment in January (names and 
 wages) to the Social Security Corporation
DESCRIPTION:The firm must give the Corporation detailed data\, with names a
 nd wages\, for workers in employment as of January\, not later than the en
 d of March every year.\nApplies to: Firms (employers) with insured workers
  under the Social Security Law\nNon-working-day rule: check the source.\n\
 nSource: https://www.ssc.gov.jo/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/law-26.1.2025-c
