 ordan\n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax advice. Dates follow the 
 recurring rule stated by the source\; weekends and holidays are not applie
 d. Sources last checked 12 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#jordan
