DTSTAMP:20261012T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=-1
SUMMARY:Jordan: New starters and leavers data to the Social Security Corpor
 ation
DESCRIPTION:Data on workers who start employment\, and on workers whose ser
 vice ends\, must reach the Corporation not later than the end of the month
  following the month of the start or the termination.\nApplies to: Firms (
 employers) with insured workers under the Social Security Law\nNon-working
 -day rule: check the source.\n\nSource: https://www.ssc.gov.jo/wp-content/
 uploads/2025/02/law-26.1.2025-compressed.pdf\nDetails: https://www.intelli
 gentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#jordan\n\nFor information only\, not legal o
 r tax advice. Dates follow the recurring rule stated by the source\; weeke
 nds and holidays are not applied. Sources last checked 12 October 2026.
